WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.236
Click Create agent

00:00:04.236 --> 00:00:07.966
Choose the WhatsApp tab

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:11.918
Pick the single-prompt WhatsApp template

00:00:11.918 --> 00:00:16.477
Name the agent and pick a voice

00:00:16.477 --> 00:00:18.911
Click Next

00:00:18.911 --> 00:00:29.104
Describe the business and the goal of the chat

00:00:29.104 --> 00:00:33.244
Add the custom variables the agent needs

00:00:33.244 --> 00:00:37.935
Select the registered WhatsApp number

00:00:37.935 --> 00:00:41.272
Click Create Assistant

00:00:41.272 --> 00:00:44.590
The agent opens in the editor

00:00:44.590 --> 00:00:50.716
WhatsApp Templates: pick what the agent may send

00:00:50.716 --> 00:01:02.802
Fill each variable: Variable, Static or Dynamic

00:01:02.802 --> 00:01:05.635
Click Save template

00:01:05.635 --> 00:01:06.938
Tag it in the prompt as @||send_payment_receipt||

00:01:06.938 --> 00:01:09.554
Attach Number shows the number this agent answers on

00:01:09.554 --> 00:01:12.073
Chat → Settings: the WhatsApp session timeouts

00:01:12.073 --> 00:01:16.264
End idle chats sooner to get results earlier

00:01:16.264 --> 00:01:20.669
Test assistant: scan the QR code from your phone
